            <description><![CDATA[<h2>MeetMouse 0.27.1</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Ending a meeting now always opens its notes. Previously only the first meeting after launching the app did; later ones went back to the home screen.</li>
  <li>Double-click the meeting bubble to open MeetMouse.</li>
  <li>Removed the extra stop button from the top of the live meeting view. End a meeting from the Stop button in the sidebar or the menu bar.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
